WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.250
Claimant: While approaching a traffic light, I accidentally struck the rear of another car while driving the 2022 fictional midsize sedan. The front bumper and hood were dented, with an estimated repair cost of $2,800; no one was injured.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.600
Adjuster: On what date did the collision occur?

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.850
Claimant: I don’t know the date of the collision.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:36.850
Adjuster: Decision: covered. The accidental collision damage is covered subject to the $500 deductible, and the supplied clauses impose no collision-date requirement. Relevant clauses: AUTO-COLL-1, AUTO-COLL-2. Confidence: 1.00.
